config BCM2835_SDHC
	bool "BCM2835 / BCM2710 / BCM2837 Arasan SDHCI host controller"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_BRCM_BCM2835_SDHCI_ENABLED
	select SDHC_SUPPORTS_NATIVE_MODE
	help
	  Enable the Broadcom BCM2835-family Arasan SDHCI host controller
	  driver. Drives the EMMC port that's wired to the CYW43439 wireless
	  chip on Pi 3 / Pi Zero 2 W. Skeleton today (methods stub out as
	  -ENOTSUP); will fill in over the SDIO bring-up.
